Soccer specific fitness training;
Tuesday: RSA and speed endurance, 5–60 s;
Thursday: repeated/explosive actions using ladders/hurdles and multi directional running;
Friday: soccer-specific dribbling track 3V3 SSGs on a 20 × 30 m;90–95% HRmax, 4–5 rounds, 4–5 min work, and rest 2–3 min
